sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Studente
    participant Browser
    participant Edge as Cloudflare + nginx
    participant App as TheBitLab app
    participant CLI as student_lab_cli.py

    Note over S: Studente già loggato nel browser
    S->>Browser: apre /auth/tui/pair
    Browser->>Edge: GET /auth/tui/pair
    Edge->>App: GET /auth/tui/pair
    App-->>Edge: 200 pagina pairing
    Edge-->>Browser: 200 pagina pairing

    S->>CLI: avvia `student_lab_cli.py pair`
    CLI->>Edge: POST /auth/tui/pairings (body vuoto)
    Note right of CLI: Header: User-Agent TheBitLab-TUI/1.0<br/>Content-Length: 0
    Edge->>App: POST /auth/tui/pairings
    App->>App: genera pairing_id + user_code
    App-->>Edge: 200 {pairing_id, user_code}
    Edge-->>CLI: 200 {pairing_id, user_code}

    Note over S: Studente legge il code sulla CLI
    S->>Browser: inserisce user_code
    Browser->>Edge: POST /auth/tui/pair {code}
    Edge->>App: POST /auth/tui/pair {code}
    App->>App: verifica cookie web + ruolo studente
    App->>App: segna pairing autorizzato
    App-->>Edge: 200 pairing ok
    Edge-->>Browser: 200 pairing ok

    CLI->>Edge: POST /auth/tui/pairings/{pairing_id}/token {code}
    Edge->>App: POST /auth/tui/pairings/{pairing_id}/token
    App->>App: consumo atomico → crea sessione TUI
    App-->>Edge: 200 {bearer_token, logout_proof, expiry}
    Edge-->>CLI: 200 {bearer_token, logout_proof, expiry}

    CLI->>Edge: GET /api/student-lab/me<br/>Authorization: Bearer ...
    Edge->>App: GET /api/student-lab/me
    App-->>Edge: 200 {student_id, class_id}
    Edge-->>CLI: 200 {student_id, class_id}

    CLI->>Edge: GET /api/student-lab/assignments<br/>Authorization: Bearer ...
    Edge->>App: GET /api/student-lab/assignments
    App-->>Edge: 200 lista consegne
    Edge-->>CLI: 200 lista consegne

    loop Comandi TUI
        S->>CLI: seleziona consegna
        CLI->>CLI: apre workspace locale
        S->>CLI: v / o / c / s
    end

    S->>CLI: comando logout
    CLI->>Edge: POST /auth/tui/logout<br/>Authorization: Bearer ...<br/>X-TUI-Logout-Proof: ...
    Edge->>App: POST /auth/tui/logout
    App->>App: revoca sessione TUI
    App-->>Edge: 204
    Edge-->>CLI: 204
